<title>USA: Storage Trust acquires 12 facilities.</title>
<headline>Storage Trust acquires 12 facilities.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Mo. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Trust Realty said Wednesday it had aquired 12 self-storage facilities since August 12.</p>
<p>The acquisitions were made with $26.4 million in cash, $1 million in seller financing, the issuance of 182,503 operating partnership units and the exchange of two self-storage facilities in Oklahoma, the company said.</p>
<p>The facilities are located in Colorado, Tennessee, Missouri, Kansas and Florida.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
